  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Akpabuyo Harmony Ladies Multipurpose Cooperative Society (AHLMCS)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project funds will be used to purchase processing equipment, inputs and trainings needed to develop capacity in palm oil production. Members will be trained in modern palm oil processing practices, and will receive a series of trainings to build the capacity of the cooperatives business management and financial management.</narrative>
  </description>
